# play.ps1 -RecordRoute: the recording starts when the gameplay HUD is back after the Kuo cutscene
# (the same anchor as tools\fast_city*.steps). The game itself records (PS3_PAD_RECORD) from the
# moment this driver creates anchor.flag.
say Route recording. Please wait, do not touch the controller.
waitimg city_hud 40,20,340,130 15 400
sleep 2
anchor
say Recording. Play now.
